From: Jie Zhang <jie.zhang@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 20:23:12 +0000
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750-mtp: Enable Adreno 830 GPU

Enable GPU for sm8750-mtp platform and provide path for zap
shader.

Signed-off-by: Jie Zhang <jie.zhang@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Akhil P Oommen <akhilpo@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260809-pakala-gpu-v1-5-207ad1fac1c7@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <andersson@kernel.org>

Link: https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/d5eee07a7818e9e65b21d61ef622cd517ab49ddf
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-mtp.dts | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-mtp.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-mtp.dts
index 9b5fbc004df4ecbb5d34734917aefe643a71e32f..b665d7a3af42b19c9dc3fab880ddfd5c964a7cfc 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-mtp.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-mtp.dts
@@ -935,6 +935,14 @@
 	};
 };
 
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&gpu_zap_shader {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8750/gen80000_zap.mbn";
+};
+
 &i2c3 {
 	status = "okay";
 
